								kind: "kontakion",
								text: "<p>Offering up sacrifices as a high priest, O father, * in the end thou didst offer thyself as a living sacrifice, * bearing witness lawfully to Christ God, * accepting death and strengthened by angels, * who cried out to thee: ** Come with us, O Phocas, and no-one will be against us!</p>",
