								kind: "kontakion",
								text: "<p>Truly thou didst show forth a great victory! * Wherefore, aflame with divine life, thou didst vanquish the corrupt king and all beautiful things, * making thine abode on Mount Maleum, * from whence thou didst ascend to the King of kings in the heavens. ** O Thomas, pray thou unceasingly for us all.</p>",
